# Google Workspace Gmail

## Gate

Use when the user asks to search mail, read a thread, draft/send/reply, or
manage labels. Prefer Google Workspace MCP (`global-mcp-first`).

## Defaults

1. Search before claiming “no mail” — use a tight query.
2. **Draft** new outbound mail unless the user explicitly said send.
3. Replies stay on the same thread when a thread id is known.
4. Never invent message or thread ids.
5. Redact secrets and tokens from excerpts in chat.
6. Batch reads when fetching several messages.

## Refuse

- Do not auto-forward or bulk-send without an explicit ask.
- Do not delete mail unless the user clearly asked to delete/trash.
